    "@en": "Yes / no question = **verbo primero**: Synger du?\n\n- Normal question → **ja** / **nej**\n- Ask with **ikke** or **aldrig** → **jo** / **nej**\n\n«Taler du ikke dansk?» → **Jo!** (I do speak) In Spanish we would say «Yes, I do!» or «Of course I do!»."
